        "body": "\n    <p><strong>Wu/Huang, 高雄榮總</strong> — Robotic intracorporeal single-stapled vs extracorporeal double-stapled anastomosis</p>\n    <p>N=49（RiSSA 31, DSA 18），左側大腸直腸癌，IPTW 校正</p>\n    <table>\n      <tr><th></th><th>RiSSA (n=31)</th><th>DSA (n=18)</th></tr>\n      <tr><td>吻合滲漏</td><td><strong>0%</strong></td><td>9.5%</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>手術時間</td><td colspan=\"2\">RiSSA 較短</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>腸功能恢復</td><td colspan=\"2\">RiSSA 較快</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>住院天數</td><td colspan=\"2\">RiSSA 較短</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>造口率</td><td colspan=\"2\">RiSSA 較低</td></tr>\n    </table>\n    <p><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11701-025-02609-6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">&#x1F4C4; DOI: 10.1007/s11701-025-02609-6</a></p>"
